--- 2026-10-12T07:25:44Z OpenSSL commit 0b7afd6d (history fetched with --filter=tree:0 from github.com/openssl/openssl)
commit 0b7afd6d303d150c13c04f66e77fcbcdaeec2a84
Author: Igor Ustinov <igus68@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2025-11-02T17:37:00+01:00
CommitDate: 2025-11-04T16:02:11+01:00

Modernize header macros for C23 compatibility

Replace old-style (int (*)()) and (char *(*)()) casts with proper typed
prototypes (i2d_of_void *, d2i_of_void *, void *(*)(void)) to comply
with stricter C23 function pointer rules.

Fixes #27938

